        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 10,
      "text": "4. The petitioners are the in-laws of the informant.",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 898,
      "end": 950,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 11,
      "text": "The prosecution allegation is that the informant was in love with Kanhu Nayak, with whom she eloped and married at a temple.",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 951,
      "end": 1075,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Kanhu Nayak",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 1017,
          "end": 1028
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 12,
      "text": "It is further alleged that the petitioners subjected her to cruelty by abusing her in obscene language and also threatened to kill her.",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 1076,
      "end": 1211,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 13,
      "text": "5. Having regard to the nature of accusations and the materials on record, I am not inclined to grant anticipatory bail.",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 1213,
      "end": 1333,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 14,
      "text": "The ABLAPL is however, disposed of granting liberty to the petitioners to surrender before the Court below within two weeks from the date of receipt of certified copy of this order and to move for bail.",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 1334,
      "end": 1536,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 15,
      "text": "In such event, they shall be released on bail on such terms and conditions as the Court below may deem fit and proper to impose including the condition that they shall not subject the informant to any kind of cruelty.",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 1537,
      "end": 1754,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
